# =============================================================================
# What must never be committed
#
# This repository is meant to become public. The live configuration holds two
# API credentials and a password hash, the state file holds every device name
# and MAC address on the network, and debugging tends to leave captures,
# backups and logs of both. The rules below are deliberately broad. A file you
# really do want tracked can be added with `git add -f` after a deliberate
# review.
# =============================================================================

# --- Live configuration and credentials --------------------------------------
# sync.env and every variant of it: backups, editor copies, .local, .production
sync.env*
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
# The sanitized template is the only env file that belongs in the repository.
# (Keep these two lines after the patterns above; the last match wins.)
!*.env.example
!.env.example

credentials.*
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
*.token
token.txt
api-key*
apikey*
.netrc
.htpasswd
htpasswd

# --- Keys and certificates ---------------------------------------------------
*.pem
*.crt
*.cer
*.der
*.key
*.csr
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.kdbx
*.gpg
id_rsa*
id_dsa*
id_ecdsa*
id_ed25519*
*_rsa
*_ecdsa
*_ed25519
deploy_key*

# --- Runtime state, captures, backups and exports -----------------------------
# state.json lists every client's name and MAC; state.json.bak-DATE and
# state.json.tmp must stay out too.
state.json*
# This project has no JSON source files, so any JSON here is state or a captured
# API response (UniFi client lists, Technitium zone dumps).
*.json
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.old
*.orig
*.rej
*.save
*.tmp
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.zone
*.zone.*
*.axfr
*.sql
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.log
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.har
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.zip
*.7z

# --- Build output --------------------------------------------------------------
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/

# --- Python ---------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Editors, OS, assistants, scratch ----------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.idea/
.vscode/
.history/
.claude/
CLAUDE.local.md
scratch/
tmp/
